---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Download | Vitana Health"
  description="Vitana Health is preparing its first public PC and Android releases."
>
  <section class="status-page">
    <div class="status-page__inner shell">
      <span class="legal-page__meta">Not released yet</span>
      <h1>Vitana is still being prepared for launch.</h1>
      <p>The open PC app and Android companion are in active development. Public download and store links will appear here when available.</p>
      <div class="status-page__actions">
        <a class="button" href="/#launch-updates">Get launch updates</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="/security">Review security</a>
      </div>
      <p class="status-note"><strong>Current plan:</strong> PC first with an Android companion, followed by MacOS/iOS in a later release.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>